allow_multiple_attempts true

markdown <<MARKDOWN
A neural network predicts how much a user will enjoy a video.

A neuron in a hidden layer answers the question "Is this video too long?" The neuron takes two inputs: the video length (in minutes) and the user's average video watch time (in minutes).

Which weights for these inputs make the most sense for this neuron?
MARKDOWN

